  "content": "<p>如需此模組的資料包版本，請前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252ffarmers-cutting-biomes-o-plenty\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><p>為<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">繽紛生態系（Biomes O' Plenty）</a>添加更多<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫樂事（Farmer's Delight）</a>的切菜板配方</p><ul>\n<li>所有木材類型的樹皮剝取與回收利用</li>\n<li>從一格高的花朵中獲取更多染料</li>\n<li>玫瑰石英方塊可分解為玫瑰石英碎塊</li>\n<li>（適用至1.19.2版本）泥磚可分解為泥磚塊</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/flowercutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"花朵切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/woodcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"木材切割\"> <img src=\"https://github.com/Joshcraft2002/farmers-cutting/blob/main/biomesoplenty/media/rosequartzcutting.png?raw=true\" alt=\"玫瑰石英切割\"></p><p>想要以單一模組整合所有農夫切割功能？請查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-cutting-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\">農夫切割合集（Farmer's Cutting Collection）</a></p>",
